{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on Life's Greatest Tiny Journey<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710850/extras/29735797fa37f5aa5d580133e9a318e6.poster.avif?t=1765275958\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710850/extras/29735797fa37f5aa5d580133e9a318e6.webm?t=1765275958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of us is a champion. We all triumphed in the most epic, microscopic race against millions to win the ultimate prize: life itself. We just don't remember the crazy ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become is a short single player, third person adventure. Experience this tiny grand journey as one of millions of sperm. Learn, adapt, and grow stronger as you explore the fascinating but dangerous microcosm of the human reproductive system. Be the one to create new life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Only the Strongest Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710850/extras/d86b1b532e1273be9a23fabe3620114e.poster.avif?t=1765275958\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710850/extras/d86b1b532e1273be9a23fabe3620114e.webm?t=1765275958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive a treacherous journey through acidic baths and antibody attacks. Master the currents, collect sugars and proteins, and evolve your cell to be the fastest, toughest, and most efficient swimmer to achieve the miracle of life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be Smart. Find Your Way.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710850/extras/d1f6337e65b88043c09fd13476bca91b.poster.avif?t=1765275958\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710850/extras/d1f6337e65b88043c09fd13476bca91b.webm?t=1765275958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will take more than just speed and resilience. Become the leader of the pack to secure your genetic legacy. Customize your unique look and dive into a thrilling and playful adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-3h linear experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to improve and develop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue buddies and use them to overcome obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, wiggle, hop, push, penetrate and surf or fight currents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape immune cells, acidic traps and break through membranes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your sperms look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the reproductive microcosm</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3710850?t=1765275958","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710850/845113bb7e03b5a6f497109243e1e8d628208e6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765275958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710850/ac1be7f450af6edc09ada298f3773aba000b1649/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765275958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710850/ac1be7f450af6edc09ada298f3773aba000b1649/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765275958","categories"